## Why This Is Asked
Tests cross-account trust, TTL-based access, and automated data restore with validation and rollback, all under realistic SLA constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-account roles with time-bounded access
- AWS Backup vaults and per-resource policies
- Data restore for S3 and DynamoDB across accounts
- Orchestration with Step Functions and EventBridge
- Validation checksums, counts, and rollback mechanisms

